				<description>&lt;p&gt;= ERP:&#xA;ERP is an attempt at creating a module based, incremental, enterprise resource planning and operations software for &lt;a href=&#34;https://iec.com.np&#34;&gt;International Electronics Concern Nepal&lt;/a&gt;. Based on Go-Lang (Echo, Pocketbase/Sqlite) Backend with a Svelte Frontend, ERP is currently a warehouse management, and  managed printing serevice tool that fills in the gaps that are not covered by traditional ERPs and Accounting Software.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
